
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Cybersecurity Hub</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0b1120;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      background: #111c31;
      padding: 24px 40px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #263550;
    }

    header h1 {
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    header p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 35px auto;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .welcome {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .welcome h2 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .welcome p {
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #111c31;
      border: 1px solid #263550;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #263550;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .panel {
      background: #111c31;
      border: 1px solid #263550;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    input {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 14px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      background: #0b1120;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: white;
    }

    button {
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background: #0284c7;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    button:disabled {
      background: #475569;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>🛡️ Cybersecurity Hub</h1>
    <p>Defensive Website Security Platform</p>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="welcome">
      <h2>Dashboard</h2>
      <p>Bienvenue sur ton centre de supervision de sécurité.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🔒 HTTPS</h3>
        <p>Vérification de la configuration HTTPS.</p>
        <span class="status">En développement</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🛡️ Security Headers</h3>
        <p>Contrôle des en-têtes HTTP de sécurité.</p>
        <span class="status">En développement</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🌐 DNS</h3>
        <p>Consultation des informations DNS publiques.</p>
        <span class="status">En développement</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>📊 Reports</h3>
        <p>Création et consultation des rapports d'audit.</p>
        <span class="status">En développement</span>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Nouvel audit</h2>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8; margin-top:10px;">
        Les analyses seront disponibles après connexion du moteur.
      </p>

      <input
        type="url"
        placeholder="https://exemple.com"
        disabled
      >

      <button disabled>
        Analyse bientôt disponible
      </button>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Historique des analyses</h2>
      <p style="color:#94a3b8; margin-top:12px;">
        Aucun rapport disponible pour le moment.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    Cybersecurity Hub © 2026 — Defensive Security Only
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
